id: SAVE8-6
package: fandhe-workshop-web
test: storage_select
target: crates/web/src/storage_select.rs
find:                 Err(e) => shared.last_async_error.set(Some(e)),
replace:                 Err(e) => { shared.last_async_error.set(Some(e)); shared.drop_local_copy(&key) }
expect-fail: put_の失敗では_localstorage_の写しが残り種類だけが記録される
note: put が失敗しても localStorage の写しを消す（唯一の写しを失う）
